	'messages:apihelp-options-param-global' => 'en:What to do if the option was set globally using the GlobalPreferences extension.

* <kbd>ignore</kbd>: Do nothing. The option remains with its previous value.
* <kbd>override</kbd>: Add a local override.
* <kbd>update</kbd>: Update the option globally.',
	'messages:apihelp-query+usercontribs-param-iprange' => 'en:The CIDR range to retrieve contributions for. Cannot be used with <var>$1user</var>, <var>$1userprefix</var>, or <var>$1userids</var>.',
	'messages:apihelp-unblock-param-watchuser' => 'en:Watch the user\'s or IP address\'s user and talk pages.',
